// Checked in. DEVELOPMENT_TEAM defaults to empty so a fresh clone never needs a real team id:
// the CI builds that don't sign use CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO, and the signed RC/TestFlight builds
// write a real value into Local.xcconfig at build time from a secret (see release.yml and
// promote-testflight.yml), the same file local development uses.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
// Here rather than in project.yml: a buildSettings value always beats an xcconfig, so the
// signed jobs couldn't switch to Manual through Local.xcconfig otherwise. #include? comes
// after, so its values win when the file exists (it silently does nothing when it doesn't).
CODE_SIGN_STYLE = Automatic
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
